<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_app_phpmyadmin">AppPhpmyadmin</link></para>

<para>This class represents the phpMyAdmin application module in the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It extends the <link linkend="_class_module">Module</link> class and provides functionalities specific to phpMyAdmin, such as configuration management and version handling. </para>
<para>
